# Next.js + React

- App Router under `src/app/`. Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only when needed (hooks, browser APIs, interactive UI).
- Server actions: `src/app/_actions/*.ts` with `"use server"`. API routes: `src/app/api/**/route.ts` with named `GET`/`POST` exports.
- Private app folders use a leading `_` (`_components`, `_hooks`, `_utils`, `_actions`, `_locales`). Do not put routes there.
- Params in Next 16 are async: `params: Promise<{ ... }>`.
- Request interception belongs in `src/proxy.ts` (`export function proxy` + `config.matcher`), not `middleware.ts`.
- Web copy / UI strings: `src/app/_locales/{en,ru}.json` via next-intl. Plugin entry: `src/app/_configs/i18n.tsx`.
- Default locale is **`ru`** (`src/configs/i18n.ts`). Keep `en` + `ru` in sync when adding keys.
- Group chat IDs are negative in Telegram; URLs often strip the leading `-` and the video page restores it when the param starts with `100`.

Canonical: `src/app/layout.tsx`, `src/app/video/[chatId]/page.tsx`, `src/app/_actions/send-photo-to-chat.ts`, `src/app/api/bot/route.ts`, `src/proxy.ts`
